<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hello {{.Data.name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">The time or the venue of an event you registered for changed. The current details:</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;">
<tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;color:#52525b;">Event</td><td style="padding:2px 0;"><strong>{{index .Data "event_title"}}</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;color:#52525b;">Organiser</td><td style="padding:2px 0;">{{index .Data "org_name"}}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;color:#52525b;">When</td><td style="padding:2px 0;">{{index .Data "when"}} (Istanbul time)</td></tr>
{{if index .Data "location"}}<tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;color:#52525b;">Where</td><td style="padding:2px 0;">{{index .Data "location"}}</td></tr>
{{end}}</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Your ticket stays the same. The updated calendar file (etkinlik.ics) is attached; open it to update your calendar.</p>
<p style="margin:0;"><a href="{{index .Data "ticket_url"}}" style="color:#1d4ed8;">Open your ticket in Koro</a></p>
